<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <title>Payment - Krishna National Contest 2026</title>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e3f2fd 0%, #bbdefb 100%);
            min-height: 100vh;
            padding: 40px 20px;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 700px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background: white;
            border-radius: 25px;
            box-shadow: 0 15px 50px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a237e 0%, #283593 100%);
            color: white;
            padding: 40px 40px 50px;
            text-align: center;
            position: relative;
        }

        .header::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            bottom: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 30px;
            background: white;
            border-radius: 50% 50% 0 0;
        }

        .header-icon {
            font-size: 48px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            animation: pulse 2s ease-in-out infinite;
        }

        @keyframes pulse {
            0%, 100% { transform: scale(1); }
            50% { transform: scale(1.1); }
        }

        .header h1 {
            font-size: 28px;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        .header p {
            font-size: 16px;
            opacity: 0.9;
        }

        .content {
            padding: 40px 40px 50px;
        }

        .section {
            margin-bottom: 35px;
        }

        .section h3 {
            color: #1a237e;
            font-size: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
        }

        .price-display {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.15) 0%, rgba(255, 193, 7, 0.1) 100%);
            padding: 25px;
            border-radius: 15px;
            text-align: center;
            border: 2px solid rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.3);
            margin: 20px 0;
        }

        .price-display .amount {
            font-size: 42px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #1a237e;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
        }

        .price-display .label {
            color: #546e7a;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        .benefits-list {
            list-style: none;
            padding: 0;
        }

        .benefits-list li {
            padding: 12px 15px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            background: rgba(76, 175, 80, 0.05);
            border-left: 4px solid #4caf50;
            border-radius: 8px;
            color: #37474f;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
        }

        .benefits-list li::before {
            content: '✓';
            color: #4caf50;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 20px;
        }

        .payment-info {
            background: rgba(33, 150, 243, 0.08);
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            border-left: 4px solid #2196f3;
            color: #455a64;
            line-height: 1.7;
        }

        .payment-btn {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 18px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4caf50 0%, #66bb6a 100%);
            color: white;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 15px;
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: 600;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(76, 175, 80, 0.3);
            margin-top: 30px;
        }

        .payment-btn:hover {
            transform: translateY(-3px);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(76, 175, 80, 0.4);
        }

        .payment-btn:active {
            transform: translateY(0);
        }

        .divider {
            height: 1px;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, #e0e0e0, transparent);
            margin: 30px 0;
        }

        .terms-section {
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #78909c;
            text-align: center;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .terms-section a {
            color: #2196f3;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        .terms-section a:hover {
            text-decoration: underline;
        }

        .back-link {
            display: inline-block;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            color: #1a237e;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 500;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            padding: 8px 15px;
            border-radius: 8px;
        }

        .back-link:hover {
            background: rgba(26, 35, 126, 0.05);
            transform: translateX(-5px);
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .content, .header {
                padding: 30px 25px;
            }

            .header h1 {
                font-size: 24px;
            }

            .price-display .amount {
                font-size: 36px;
            }

            .section h3 {
                font-size: 18px;
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 480px) {
            body {
                padding: 20px 15px;
            }

            .content, .header {
                padding: 25px 20px;
            }

            .price-display {
                padding: 20px;
            }

            .price-display .amount {
                font-size: 32px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <a href="/dashboard" class="back-link">← Back to Dashboard</a>

    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <div class="header-icon">🕉️</div>
            <h1>Krishna National Contest 2026</h1>
            <p>Complete Your Registration</p>
        </div>

        <div class="content">
            <div class="section">
                <h3>💰 Participation Fee</h3>
                <div class="price-display">
                    <div class="amount">₹399</div>
                    <div class="label">per contest</div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="section">
                <h3>🎁 What You Get</h3>
                <ul class="benefits-list">
                    <li>Official participation certificate</li>
                    <li>Chance to win exciting prizes</li>
                    <li>Spiritual book as a gift</li>
                    <li>Recognition at national level</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="section">
                <h3>💳 Payment Gateway</h3>
                <div class="payment-info">
                    <strong>Secure payment integration with HDFC Bank</strong> will be enabled shortly. 
                    Your payment information is encrypted and secure. We never store your card details.
                </div>
            </div>

            <form action="/payment-initiate" method="POST">
                <button type="submit" class="payment-btn">
                    Proceed to Pay ₹399 →
                </button>
            </form>

            <div class="divider"></div>

            <div class="terms-section">
                By proceeding, you agree to our 
                <a href="/terms">Terms & Conditions</a> and 
                <a href="/refund-policy">Refund Policy</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
